+# Design: The Future-Fit Gallery
+
+## Frame
+
+- 1920 × 1080, with a 120 px outer content margin and a reserved lower footer zone.
+- Deep navy gallery walls establish focus; white cards provide legible editorial surfaces.
+- Gold identifies the active choice, while blue connects evidence to the next move.
+
+## Type
+
+- Proxima Nova with system sans-serif fallback.
+- Compact uppercase labels orient the viewer.
+- Headlines stay between 64 and 92 px; supporting text stays at or above 40 px.
+
+## Components
+
+- Gallery frames: white evidence cards with restrained borders and shadows.
+- Selection lenses: three outlined chips for strengths, scope, and impact.
+- RAMS builder: four connected cards, each expanding into its plain-language meaning.
+- Direction line: a blue route with a gold endpoint that becomes the final visual resolve.
+
+## Motion
+
+- A single paused GSAP timeline owns all movement and is seekable by HyperFrames.
+- Each beat enters with short fades, vertical movement, and line draws; exits clear the content layer before the next beat.
+- No infinite animation or unsynchronized media is used.
+- The final second adds a gold endpoint and resolves the direction line.
